# ------------------------------------------------- manufacturer source drops
# ~150 MB of datasheets, archives and example projects for other boards.
# Not needed to build, not ours to redistribute. Kept on the dev machine only.
#
# Two deliberate exceptions:
#   README.md  -> explains the exclusion to anyone browsing the repo
#   YFROBOTRFIDI2C-1.0.3-original/ -> pristine upstream driver, so the patches
#                                    in lib/YFROBOTRFIDI2C/PATCHES.md stay diffable
docs/vendor/*
!docs/vendor/README.md
!docs/vendor/YFROBOTRFIDI2C-1.0.3-original/
